# The one list of kit files. install.py, doctor.py and the tests read it; nothing else keeps a second list.
# Format: group|mode|source (relative to kit/)|destination (relative to the project)
# Modes: copy | copy-exec (executable bit) | merge-json (merged into an existing file of the same name, never replaced)
# Groups: core (any guard adapter needs it), tool:<name> (one per tool), githooks, scripts, scripts:ps, scripts:sh,
#         handoff:ps, handoff:sh, tests, tests:ps, tests:sh. A file listed in two groups is installed once.
